@startuml
title 数据模型结构

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

struct TodoItem {
    + QString uuid
    + QString lastModified
    + QString title
    + QString description
    + QString dueDate
    + bool completeFlag
    + bool offlineAdd
    + bool offlineDelete
    + TodoItem()
}

note right of TodoItem
  待办事项数据结构
  - uuid: 唯一标识符
  - lastModified: 时间戳
  - offlineAdd: 离线添加
  - offlineDelete: 离线删除
end note

@enduml
